 "description": "You know, dude. Beats.",
 "strategy": "Well, use Double Back to get out Iggy and start Tunnel Visioning once per turn, you want to pull a Hutt Smooch/Stunning Leader quickly to avoid nasty spy beats. Then, just beat on opponent. Pull Executor at start of game, when you get Thrawn and have enough force you can drop them on some poor blighter. Drop First Strike when opp has no force left and you’re looking for the beat, besides that and the bullets you’re going to want to get all your effects out, probably Despair (V) first. Drop Lando (V) at the prison when Iggy is there. Just beat.",
